 {"t": 107.62, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 107.5}, {"t": 108.12, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 108.0}, {"t": 108.62, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 108.5}, {"t": 109.12, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 109.0}, {"t": 109.62, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 109.5}, {"t": 110.12, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 110.0}, {"t": 110.62, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 110.5}, {"t": 111.12, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 111.0}, {"t": 111.62, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 111.5}, {"t": 112.12, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 112.0}, {"t": 112.62, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 112.5}, {"t": 113.12, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 113.0}, {"t": 113.62, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 113.5}, {"t": 114.12, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 114.0}, {"t": 114.51, "kind": "inputTranscription", "text": "小林 は 「 乗客 は 電車 が 創造 する 」 と いう 言葉 を 掲げ た 。 箕面 や 宝塚 に は 遊覧 施設 を 作り 、 池田 に は 日本 初 の 郊外 型 分譲 住宅 地 ・ 池田 新 市街 、 後 の 室町 住宅 を 作っ た 。"}, {"t": 114.62, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 114.5}, {"t": 114.779, "kind": "outputTranscription", "text": "他想，比起環境污染嚴重的市中心，乾淨空氣的郊區才應該是人們居住的地方吧。小林提出「乘客是由電車創造的」這句話。他在箕面和寶塚建造了遊樂設施，在池田則建造了日本第一個郊區型分售住宅區——池田新市街，也就是後來的室町住宅。"}, {"t": 114.78, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 12840}, {"t": 114.823, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 12800}, {"t": 114.887, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 15360}, {"t": 114.986, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 23040}, {"t": 115.069, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 20480}, {"t": 115.12, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 115.0}, {"t": 115.157, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 20480}, {"t": 115.26, "kind": "turnComplete"}, {"t": 115.62, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 115.5}, {"t": 116.12, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 116.0}, {"t": 116.62, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 116.5}, {"t": 117.119, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 117.0}, {"t": 117.62, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 117.5}, {"t": 118.12, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 118.0}, {"t": 118.62, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 118.5}, {"t": 119.12, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 119.0}, {"t": 119.619, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 119.5}, {"t": 120.12, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 120.0}, {"t": 120.62, "kind": 